  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Despite deep divisions inside the BRICS family, the Delhi Declaration has seen consensus on several issues.",
      "start": 0.24,
      "end": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "India's Prime Minister Nuraindamodi made the announcement this afternoon on day one of the summit.",
      "start": 7.12,
      "end": 13.120000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "New Delhi Declaration.",
      "start": 13.44,
      "end": 14.88
    },
    {
      "text": "BRICS Nations have expressed deep concern over the escalating tensions in the Gulf.",
      "start": 25.6,
      "end": 30.560000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "They've called for maximum restraint to avoid a wider regional war, but they've fallen short of naming any country.",
      "start": 30.72,
      "end": 38.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Ahead of the summit, Iran wanted member states to condemn the US and Israeli aggression.",
      "start": 38.480000000000004,
      "end": 45.28
    },
    {
      "text": "The declaration has also emphasized the need for protecting civilians safeguarding critical infrastructure like nuclear infrastructure under the International Atomic Energy Agency.",
      "start": 45.52,
      "end": 56.160000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "BRICS Nations have been feeling the full force of the US tariffs.",
      "start": 83.12,
      "end": 87.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So in this declaration, they have opposed any unilateral tariffs and sanctions.",
      "start": 87.36,
      "end": 93.28
    },
    {
      "text": "They say it goes against international law.",
      "start": 93.44,
      "end": 96.08
    },
    {
      "text": "In their declaration, BRICS Nations have taken aim at the highest power structure of the UN, the United Nations Security Council, calling for it to be more democratic with more representation from Asia, Africa, and Latin America.",
      "start": 96.32000000000001,
      "end": 111.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Apart from the so-called Delhi Declaration, we've seen bilateral meetings between leaders of India and China and the United Arab Emirates and Iran.",
      "start": 111.28,
      "end": 120.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Beijing has offered to mediate between Washington and Tehran to resolve the ongoing Gulf crisis.",
      "start": 120.48,
      "end": 127.04
    }
  ]
}